WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:05.000
Think about the last app that just worked.

2
00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:11.067
The one you used without thinking. Without confusion. Without frustration.

3
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:16.800
That is not an accident. That is design doing its job perfectly.

4
00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:22.867
Good UI is invisible — you never notice it because it never gets in your way.

5
00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:28.567
Every button placement is a decision. Every font size. Every color.

6
00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:34.300
These choices happen long before a single line of code is written.

7
00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:39.500
Bad UI demands attention. Good UI quietly serves the user.

8
00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:45.367
UX design is about understanding how people think, and where they get stuck.

9
00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:50.733
Then removing every obstacle between them and what they came to do.

10
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:56.800
The best interfaces feel obvious. Like they could not have been built any other way.

11
00:00:56.967 --> 00:01:02.167
Making the complex feel completely simple — that is the real skill.

12
00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:03.967
Learn UI/UX design at 0xverse Academy.

